cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "cavsim3d: 3D finite-element simulation and model order reduction of RF structures"
abstract: >-
  A Python library for 3D electromagnetic simulation of RF structures (cavities,
  waveguides, multi-part assemblies) with the NGSolve finite element engine, and
  for model order reduction by proper orthogonal decomposition: sections are
  solved and reduced on their own and joined through their port modes.
authors:
  - family-names: Udongwo
    given-names: Sosoho-Abasi
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Dark-Elektron/cavsim3d"
url: "https://dark-elektron.github.io/cavsim3d/"
keywords:
  - electromagnetics
  - finite element method
  - RF cavity
  - model order reduction
  - waveguide
